  "Title": "ELSA-2026-500695: nginx:1.26 security update (IMPORTANT)",
  "Description": "[2:1.26.3-10.0.3.3]\n- Bump release\n\n[2:1.26.3-10.0.1.3]\n- Require oracle-indexhtml\n\n[2:1.26.3-17]\n- Resolves: RHEL-309731 - nginx:1.26/nginx: NGINX use-after-free condition\n  in the resolver (CVE-2026-123634)\n\n[2:1.26.3-16]\n- Fixes CVE-2026-118899 and CVE-2026-113425\n\n[2:1.26.3-15]\n- Fixes CVE-2026-121810\n\n[2:1.26.3-13]\n- Fixes CVE-2026-123633 and CVE-2026-123007\n\n[2:1.26.3-12]\n- Fixes CVE-2026-97205 and CVE-2026-15176\n\n[2:1.26.3-11]\n- Fixes CVE-2026-9256, CVE-2026-42055 and HTTP/2: Remote Denial of Service\n  via compression bomb and Slowloris-style attack\n\n[2:1.26.3-10]\n- Fixes CVE-2026-9256, CVE-2026-42055 and HTTP/2: Remote Denial of Service\n  via compression bomb and Slowloris-style attack\n\n[2:1.26.3-9]\n- Resolves: RHEL-176236 - nginx:1.26/nginx: NGINX:",
